# SPEC — homebrew-dotdog

> Homebrew tap for dotdog CLI. One formula. Zero config.

## Product

`brew install dotdog` — the macOS-native way to install dotdog. Formula downloads from npm, installs via Homebrew, tests with `--version`.

### Flow

```
brew tap specdog/dotdog → brew install dotdog → dotdog --version → 0.3.5
```

## Architecture

| Component | Role |
|-----------|------|
| Formula | Ruby file defining download URL, dependencies, install steps |
| Tap | Git repo hosting the formula |
| Homebrew | Package manager that reads taps and installs formulas |
| npm | Source of the dotdog tarball |
